        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Kafka · Throughput\nPer-resource rollup per_topic_throughput. &nbsp;·&nbsp; pack `kafka@1.0.0` &nbsp;·&nbsp; [Unified](/d/kafka-unified?${__url_time_range}) · [Cluster overview](/d/kafka-cluster-overview?${__url_time_range}) · [Consumer lag](/d/kafka-consumer-lag?${__url_time_range}) · **Throughput** · [Slo burn](/d/kafka-slo-burn?${__url_time_range})",
